# Retrieval regression suite - 20 production lookups, one per real failure mode
# found during the 2026-08-06/07 diagnostics. Run it with:
#
#     python -m benchmark.run_retrieval_regression
#
# Purpose (and the difference from production_queries.jsonl): that file has 5
# answer-oriented cases and is deliberately small; it did not move at all
# across the 2026-08-08 reindex even though four of the queries below changed
# rank substantially. This file is the sensitive one - it exists so that any
# future change to retrieval, chunking or extraction can be measured instead
# of argued about.
#
# GROUND TRUTH RULES - read before adding or editing a case:
#
#  1. Every `expected_documents` needle below was resolved by SQL against the
#     real index before being written here, and the resulting document count
#     is recorded in that case's `notes`. Do not add a needle you have not
#     counted.
#  2. Prefer a needle that resolves to ONE document, or to one tight family of
#     revisions of the same document. A needle that matches a whole folder
#     makes the case pass trivially and blind to regressions - the 2026-08-06
#     ground-truth repair of production_queries.jsonl was caused by exactly
#     that, and the first draft of this file repeated it (`SG Geosan` matched
#     95 documents, `Zakládání Group` 217).
#  3. Matching is diacritics- and case-insensitive substring against the
#     result's path (benchmark/metrics.row_matches_any), so NFD vs NFC on
#     macOS paths is not something a case has to care about.
#
# Ranks quoted in `notes` are from the 2026-08-08 post-reindex measurement
# against 6342 docs / 157037 chunks and are informational only - the machine
# -readable baseline lives in benchmark/baselines/retrieval_regression.json.
{"id": "rr-sod-haus365-01", "domain": "SoD", "question": "smlouva o dílo Haus365 SIS", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "easy", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["SOD_HAUS365"], "tags": ["retrieval-regression"], "notes": "11 documents - the whole revision family of one contract (návrh/rev2/k podpisu/připomínky), which is the intended answer for a query naming no revision. Broadest ground truth in this file; treat a rank change here as weak evidence."}
{"id": "rr-sod-nds-property-revize-01", "domain": "SoD", "question": "revize smlouvy o dílo NDS Property SIS Systémy", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "hard", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["Revize_250213"], "tags": ["retrieval-regression", "chunking"], "notes": "1 document. THE monolithic-chunk case: before the CHUNK_MAX_SIZE fix this file was 2 chunks with a 114221-char maximum, BGE-M3 silently embedded a fraction of it, and the query missed the top 10 entirely. Post-reindex it is 456 chunks / 2095 max and ranks #1. A MISS here means chunk capping regressed."}
{"id": "rr-dodatek-hilti-rent-01", "domain": "dodatky", "question": "dodatek č.1 Hilti Rent podchycení sloupů", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "medium", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["podchycení sloupů_Hilt Rent_dod", "Podchycení_sloupů_HILT-Rent_dodatek"], "tags": ["retrieval-regression"], "notes": "2 documents (the signed dodatek and its confirmation). Needle is deliberately narrower than 'Hilti', which matches an unrelated delivery note, and than 'podchycení', which matches 10 documents of the whole procurement including the original SoD."}
{"id": "rr-dodatek-geosan-vrty-01", "domain": "dodatky", "question": "dodatek SoD geotermální vrty SG Geosan", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "medium", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["SG Geosan_dodč.1", "SG Geosan_tHEJ - dodatek"], "tags": ["retrieval-regression"], "notes": "5 documents - the dodatek in its .docx/.pdf/signed variants. A bare 'SG Geosan' needle matched 95 documents (the entire supplier folder) and is not usable."}
{"id": "rr-haus365-tp-monolit-01", "domain": "Haus365", "question": "Haus365 technologický postup monolit", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "medium", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["TP Smíchov monolit"], "tags": ["retrieval-regression"], "notes": "1 document. GROUND TRUTH CORRECTED 2026-08-08: the earlier needle 'VT 11_HAUS365' pointed at a quantity SPREADSHEET (výkaz), not a technological procedure, so the case measured the wrong document; before that it used a bare 'haus365' needle matching 60 documents and passed unconditionally."}
{"id": "rr-haus365-kladecsky-plan-01", "domain": "Haus365", "question": "Haus365 kladečský plán výrobní dokumentace", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "hard", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["kladeč"], "expected_content_missing": true, "tags": ["retrieval-regression", "known-limitation"], "notes": "0 documents: no file matching 'kladeč' is in the index and FTS finds no chunk containing the term either, so no retrieval change can make this pass. Kept as a tripwire - the day the source folder gains the drawing, this case flips to HIT and tells us. MISS is the expected result and is not counted as a retrieval failure."}
{"id": "rr-haus365-predani-pracoviste-01", "domain": "Haus365", "question": "předání pracoviště Haus365", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "easy", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["předání pracoviště"], "tags": ["retrieval-regression"], "notes": "5 documents - the handover-record form and its filled copies."}
{"id": "rr-zl-roznaseci-deska-01", "domain": "změnové listy", "question": "změnový list roznášecí deska FERI", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "medium", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["Zmenovy_list_FERI"], "tags": ["retrieval-regression"], "notes": "2 documents (change list 001 and 002 for FERI-Garáže). No document has 'roznášecí' in its name, so the needle names the change-list family the query is about."}
{"id": "rr-zl-prehled-gd-01", "domain": "změnové listy", "question": "přehled změnových listů GD", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "medium", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["přehled ZL GD"], "tags": ["retrieval-regression", "xlsx"], "notes": "6 documents (dated revisions of one overview spreadsheet). GROUND TRUTH CORRECTED 2026-08-08: the old needle 'Zmenovy_list' pointed at INDIVIDUAL change lists, not at the overview the query asks for, and made the case report a false regression across the reindex (#7 -> #9) at the very moment the actual overview spreadsheets entered the top 10 for the first time. With the correct needle the same two runs read MISS -> #3. These are .xlsx files that were unreadable before the extractor fix, so this case now doubles as XLSX extraction coverage."}
{"id": "rr-zl-006-demolice-01", "domain": "změnové listy", "question": "ZL 006 demolice podzemních objektů", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "easy", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["ZL 006"], "tags": ["retrieval-regression"], "notes": "7 documents - the change list plus its revisions and attachments."}
{"id": "rr-tp-odvodneni-watersystem-01", "domain": "TP", "question": "technologický postup odvodnění Watersystem", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "medium", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["VT 5_WATERSYSTEM"], "tags": ["retrieval-regression"], "notes": "1 document. A bare 'WATERSYSTEM' needle matched 22 documents (the supplier folder) and was too weak to detect ranking changes."}
{"id": "rr-tp-strikane-betony-01", "domain": "TP", "question": "technologický postup stříkané betony ZG", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "medium", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["strikane betony"], "tags": ["retrieval-regression"], "notes": "5 documents. The filename is unaccented ('Technologicky postup strikane betony ND') while the query is accented - matching folds diacritics, so this case also covers that folding."}
{"id": "rr-bozp-prohlaseni-zhotovitele-01", "domain": "BOZP", "question": "prohlášení zhotovitele k BOZP a PO", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "easy", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["Prohlášení zhotovitele k BOZP"], "tags": ["retrieval-regression"], "notes": "6 documents - the declaration form as filed per supplier."}
{"id": "rr-bozp-safetypeak-01", "domain": "BOZP", "question": "BOZP SafetyPeak podepsaná", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "medium", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["SafetyPeak_podepsaná"], "tags": ["retrieval-regression"], "notes": "1 document. The query asks for the SIGNED copy specifically, so the needle must exclude the unsigned NOT250060_BOZP_SafetyPeak.docx sitting next to it - a bare 'SafetyPeak' needle matched 54 documents and could not tell the two apart."}
{"id": "rr-kzp-monolit-feri-01", "domain": "KZP", "question": "kontrolní a zkušební plán monolit FERI", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "hard", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["KZP monolit", "KZP- ŽB monolitické"], "expected_retrieval_issue": true, "tags": ["retrieval-regression", "known-limitation", "vocabulary-mismatch"], "notes": "4 documents, all indexed and chunked. Diagnosed vocabulary mismatch: the query spells out 'kontrolní a zkušební plán' while the documents only use the acronym 'KZP', and 'FERI' does not appear in any target name (they are the Smíchov KZPs). Reindexing could not and did not help - with expansion off the query reached only rank 29 in ai_search.search(limit=200). Enabling the FTS branch of query expansion (ai_search_config.QUERY_EXPANSION_MODE='fts', 2026-08-08) emits the missing 'KZP' term and brings it to rank 9. The flag stays: rank 9 of 10 is one displaced competitor away from a miss, so this is a mitigated limitation, not a closed one."}
{"id": "rr-kzp-seznam-tp-01", "domain": "KZP", "question": "seznam TP a KZP dodavatelů", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "medium", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["seznam TP a KZP"], "expected_keywords": ["KZP"], "tags": ["retrieval-regression", "xlsx"], "notes": "1 document (NDS_seznam TP a KZP.xlsx). THE xlsx-extraction case: the old extractor emitted shared-string INDICES instead of text and produced 4 chunks with a 6761-char maximum; the row-aware extractor produces 18 chunks averaging 767 chars and the rank moved #9 -> #1. A drop back toward #9 means spreadsheet extraction regressed."}
{"id": "rr-faktura-nazarenko-01", "domain": "fakturace", "question": "faktura Nazarenko stavební práce", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "medium", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["NOT252167"], "tags": ["retrieval-regression"], "notes": "6 documents sharing the order number. The needle is the order number rather than the surname on purpose: 'Nazarenko' also matches attendance sheets and hour summaries (11 documents) that are not the invoice the query asks for."}
{"id": "rr-prefakturace-gd-zg-01", "domain": "fakturace", "question": "přefakturace nákladů GD na ZG", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "medium", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["přefakturace nákladů GD"], "tags": ["retrieval-regression"], "notes": "3 documents - the re-invoicing statement and its revisions."}
{"id": "rr-predavaci-protokol-zg-01", "domain": "předání dokumentace", "question": "předávací protokol Zakládání Group staveniště", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "medium", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["Predavaci_protokol_Zakladani_Group"], "tags": ["retrieval-regression", "truncation"], "notes": "1 document. This is the case that exposed the post-rerank truncation bug in ui_services.search_all(): it sat at pool rank 11 and the pre-fix [:result_count] cut discarded it before dedup/diversify ran. A MISS here means that truncation ordering regressed. A bare 'Zakládání Group' needle matched 217 documents and is not usable."}
{"id": "rr-email-feri-terminy-01", "domain": "e-maily", "question": "e-mail FERI závazné termíny SoD monolit", "type": "lookup", "difficulty": "easy", "environment": "production", "expected_documents": ["závazné termíny"], "tags": ["retrieval-regression", "eml"], "notes": "1 document (.eml). Only e-mail case in the suite - covers that .eml extraction still reaches the index."}
